================================================================================
Derivation and attribution
================================================================================

crustagent is a from-scratch Rust implementation of the classic Microsoft Agent
character system. Its byte-level file formats and playback rules were
reverse-engineered from Microsoft's own runtime binaries (Char11.dll, AgentDp2.dll,
AgentDpv.dll, AgentAnm.dll and the 1.5 DocFile provider), cross-checked against
Microsoft's published Agent documentation, and confirmed by parsing sample
character files. Those findings are written up in this repository as
docs/acs-format.md (.acs / .acf / .aca) and docs/act-format.md (Microsoft Actor
.act); the parsers, the image codec, the frame compositor and the animation
sequencer are implemented from those documents.

Everything else — the embedding API and action queue (crustagent), the windowed
renderer (crustagent-render), the text-to-speech and audio integration
(crustagent-tts, crustagent-audio), and the GIF encoder (crustagent-gif) — is
original to this project.

================================================================================
Microsoft Agent
================================================================================

The ".acs" character file format and the Microsoft Agent characters (Clippit,
Merlin, Genie, Peedy, Robby, etc.) and their artwork are the property of
Microsoft Corporation and the respective character authors. "Microsoft" and
"Microsoft Agent" are trademarks of Microsoft Corporation. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft.

No Microsoft Agent character assets (.acs / .acf / .aca / .acd files or their
artwork or sounds) are included in this repository. Character files are supplied
by the user at runtime.

